			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Multum tibi debeo, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> doctissime, quod solus in angustia <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>praeli opem tulisti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mitto nunc ad te historiam <persName ref="p4631">Diazii</persName>, de qua libenter <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>audiam tuum iudicium.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Reliqua exemplaria inter fratres distribue, ad quos <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>omnes non potui scribere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quaterniones seorsim pertinent ad d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Sarcinulam mittes <placeName ref="l473">Santgallum</placeName>, et quam isthic habes ad me, quaeso, ut <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>prima oportunitate mittas.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De tyranno nostro<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> fuit constans rumor illum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>aufugisse, sed postea res ostendit fuisse vanum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Utinam male pereat, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quando non vult resipiscere.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si enim in hoc tempore manet in castris, fortassis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non poterit anno proximo pręliari.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nescio quid subaudivi de conditionibus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>pacis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Si quid habes, communica.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Idem ego sum facturus, si prior aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>intellexero.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p18250">Moritz von Sachsen</persName>.</note> et <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemis</placeName> quod hactenus vulgato rumore <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>audivimus, est nimis verum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Si <persName ref="p3590">Philippus</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> esset apud nos, reliqua <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>non tanti facerem, quanquam etiam aliis de causis doleo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Si potero [me] <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>hinc liberare circa festum natalicium, fortasse vos invisam.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Remitto decreta <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l1107">Tridentina</placeName> et gratiam habeo.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Impressa quoque mittam, ubi erunt absoluta.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">26. novembris 1546.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8032">Franciscus Dryander</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>episcopo fidelissimo in <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesia dei, quae est <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>